diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 399a783..203413d 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,4 +6,11 @@ Shares one composite action across the repository's workflows.
 
 | Action | Purpose |
 |--------|---------|
-| `actions/setup-toolchain` | Installs the toolchain and restores the build cache. |
+| `actions/setup-toolchain` | Installs the toolchain, lints with ruff, and restores the build cache. The cache key includes the runner OS, the toolchain version, and a hash of `uv.lock`, so a lockfile change invalidates it. |
+
+## Workflows
+
+| Workflow | Job | Runner |
+|----------|-----|--------|
+| `ci` | `test` | `ubuntu-latest` |
+| `ci` | `test-windows` | `windows-latest` |
